### Universum Infinitum - Character Traits
### Sprite definitions for the mod's trait icons.
###
### Since Galactic Paragons (and therefore Stellaris 4.x) leader trait icons are
### declared as sprites referenced from the trait definition, rather than as a raw
### texture path. These entries expose the DDS files shipped in
### gfx/interface/icons/traits/ under names referenced by ui-traits_leader_*.txt.

spriteTypes = {
	spriteType = {
		name = "GFX_ui_trait_berserker"
